fields.value:
 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Penitence icon0}}
| desc = Damages enemy unit, forces it to move slower and lets allies attack it more quickly.
}}
* {{Symbol|Projectile|Base}}
** Has {{#var:Penitence basic1}}-{{M|projectile speed}}.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Self}} {{Symbol|bonus atk}}
** Grants bonus attack range of the same range-type as the caster.
** Has an [[attack range]] of {{calc|v1+{{Show|H|Chen|atkrange}}|v1={{#var:Penitence type1 value1}}}} on the debuff-affected enemy unit.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
** {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|chen_penitence}}
*** {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|penitence_self_attack_range}} checks for the debuff upon the unit's {{M|attack point}}.
*** Hence, the first attack benefits from the applied {{M|ranged}} bonus {{M|attack range}} from previous valid attacks.

