fields.value:
 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Hand of God icon0}}
| desc = Heals all allied heroes on the map as well as all units under Chen's control. A large heal is applied at first and a slow heal over time is applied for 10 seconds afterwards.
}}
* {{Symbol|fx|s}}
** The following voicelines upon cast is {{M|Global}} ally-only:
*** <ab>vo_chen_chen_ability_handgod_01.mp3</ab> Hand of God!
*** <ab>vo_chen_chen_ability_handgod_02.mp3</ab> A healing hand.
*** <ab>vo_chen_chen_ability_handgod_03.mp3</ab> All are healed.

* {{Symbol|bonus hprestore}}
** Can heal up to {{calc|v1+v2*({{#var:Hand of God value4}}-2)|v1={{#var:Hand of God value2}}|v2={{#var:Hand of God value3}}}} {{M|health}} over the entire duration.
<hr>
* {{cf|aghnotes}} {{Symbol|a|Up}} {{Symbol|Magic Resistance}} {{Symbol|Affect|Self}} 
** Affected allied heroes now have the following [[magic resistance]] values:
:: {{{!}} class="wikitable" style="margin-top:3px; font-size:80%;"
{{!}} style="width:400px;" {{!}} {{Symbol|Magic Resistance|size=17px}} Base[[Magic Resistance|MagRes]] {{=}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|1-(1-{{G|magic resistance}})*(1-v1)|v1={{#var:Hand of God type3 value3 agh}}|%}}|agh}}
{{!}}-
{{!}} style="width:400px;" {{!}} Increases the total {{Symbol|Magic Resistance|size=17px}} by {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1*{{G|bonus magic resistance}}*10|v1={{#var:Hand of God type3 value3 agh}}|%}}|agh}} per {{Symbol|bonus int|size=17px}} 10 [[Intelligence|int]].
{{!}}}

